    course_description = '<p> This course articulates with the Master of Studies and allows students to undertake the initial four units of optional breadth before progressing into the full master''s degree. In consultation with the course adviser, students will complete 4 units (24 points) of breadth from units available in all faculties. At the completion of the 4 units (24 points), each student may decide whether to articulate into the Master of Studies. </p>',
