    course_description = 'The course will explore structural and systemic issues as well as the practical application of evidence-informed frameworks for practice. The principles of strengths-based intervention, culturally competent practice, capacity building and inclusivity will be central to the learning.<br/> The graduate certificate is intended for people who already hold a degree but who wish to undertake further study so that they can proceed to a graduate diploma and possibly also a master''s degree, or who wish to obtain advanced qualifications in a specific area of expertise.<br/>',
