UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p> Western Australia’s coastal and nearshore seascape includes a diversity of morphology, habitats, and environmental forcing which will allow you to gain first-hand experience in the field. You’ll learn about the processes that drive coastal changes, the importance of ocean currents in determining our sea level and climate, the links and feedbacks between physical and biological processes, and about strategies to manage the coast as a resource for all. </p>',
