UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p> The Master of Building Information Modelling at UWA is designed by industry professionals to prepare the next generation of leaders in the architecture, engineering, and construction (AEC) industries. <br/> <br/> This program enhances your BIM expertise by immersing you in advanced, data-driven applications of building information models, providing you with hands-on experience to drive major infrastructure projects, including water systems, roads, bridges, and more. <br/> <br/> With a strong focus on innovation, the program empowers you to develop solutions to the technological, economic, and environmental challenges shaping the future of the built environment. Aligned with UK, Australian, and US BIM standards, this globally relevant qualification helps you to acquire skills valued locally and internationally. </p>',
