    course_description = '<p> Audiology is the clinical science involving the prevention, assessment and rehabilitation of hearing loss and associated communication disorders.<br/> <br/> The course provides students with extensive supervised clinical placements in a variety of workplace settings. Employment prospects for Audiologists who graduate from UWA are excellent both within Australia and overseas. Graduates are eligible for full membership of Audiology Australia. </p>',
