UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>The Master of Professional Accounting (Chartered Accounting) is ideal if you are seeking to fast-track your journey to a professional accounting career with a qualification that will distinguish you in the employment market. <br/> <br/> As a dual qualification, you will complete both the Master of Professional Accounting and the prestigious Chartered Accountants (CA) program concurrently, offering a supportive and integrated pathway to becoming a Chartered Accountant. By studying these programs together, you will complete both qualifications in just two and a half years – saving you up to two years compared to undertaking them separately (CA ANZ). <br/> <br/> For the advanced units in the CA Program, you will receive customised training in small classes as well as ongoing mentoring from experienced UWA academics. </p>',
