    course_description = '<p>The course is led by highly qualified, experienced, research-active and accessible experts in the field, with strong ties to the profession and community services and you will benefit from our research-led teaching, based on up-to-date data allowing you to apply the most relevant theory to your social work practice.</p> <p>The Master of Social Work is the most established Masters course in WA, with Social Work being first taught at UWA in 1965.</p>',
