UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>The Music and Society major develops your skills and expertise in thinking critically about music. Discover Music’s broad range of styles and contexts, encompassing its histories, social and political meanings, and performance and listening practices.</p> <p>Broaden your studies and study this major alongside many different degrees at UWA. This unique offering is for anyone wanting to add critical thought and culture to their learning experience.</p>',
