chelor''s degree, is a great way to enhance your career prospects.</p> <p><strong>Second majors could include:</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="/study/courses/fine-arts">Fine Arts</a></li> <li><a href="/study/courses/geographical-sciences">Geography</a> </li> <li><a href="/study/courses/applied-human-geography">Human Geography and Planning</a></li> </ul> Bachelor of Environmental Design Majors available',
